(7030690, 1067029, 64989, '<td valign="top">I love the strategic placement of the grain, subtle and effective.</td>', 'I love the strategic placement of the grain, subtle and effective.', '2013-05-01 22:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7030691, 1067265, 64989, '<td valign="top">Looks like a photo I could have found in my grandmother''s attic. And I would have wanted to know who this woman was, and where she was going.  Is that a grocery basket? Maybe she''s heading home to make Sunday supper....<br/>It''s images that keep me thinking that really captivate me.  Very very nice.</td>', 'Looks like a photo I could have found in my grandmother''s attic. And I would have wanted to know who this woman was, and where she was going.  Is that a grocery basket? Maybe she''s heading home to make Sunday supper....It''s images that keep me thinking that really captivate me.  Very very nice.', '2013-05-01 22:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7030693, 1067273, 64989, '<td valign="top">This has a feeling of an old painting I would find in a funky antique mall.  Really well seen.</td>', 'This has a feeling of an old painting I would find in a funky antique mall.  Really well seen.', '2013-05-01 22:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7030694, 1067562, 64989, '<td valign="top">I like the color of the light here. My only small note is that I would like to see more space at the top of the frame.</td>', 'I like the color of the light here. My only small note is that I would like to see more space at the top of the frame.', '2013-05-01 22:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7030695, 1067505, 64989, '<td valign="top">The grain in the highlights to the right of the frame have a misty feeling, works very well with the location/subject.</td>', 'The grain in the highlights to the right of the frame have a misty feeling, works very well with the location/subject.', '2013-05-01 22:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7030696, 1067456, 64989, '<td valign="top">The application of the grain in the right areas really draws me to her eyes.  Nice.</td>', 'The application of the grain in the right areas really draws me to her eyes.  Nice.', '2013-05-01 22:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7030699, 1067336, 64989, '<td valign="top">Only one thing bothers my OCD brain.  The pier isn''t straight in the frame.  I scored it well, as I think the grain really added to the feel of the picture, and you made a wonderful image that showcased the theme.</td>', 'Only one thing bothers my OCD brain.  The pier isn''t straight in the frame.  I scored it well, as I think the grain really added to the feel of the picture, and you made a wonderful image that showcased the theme.', '2013-05-01 22:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7030700, 1067110, 64989, '<td valign="top">This is just cool.  It feels like it could be the cover to the DVD for a spy movie.</td>', 'This is just cool.  It feels like it could be the cover to the DVD for a spy movie.', '2013-05-01 22:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7030701, 1067237, 64989, '<td valign="top">Great image, I love the perspective.  And even though the drum is front and center, the drummers smile pulls my eye to him as well.  The grain also adds to the image, fulfilling the challenge well.</td>', 'Great image, I love the perspective.  And even though the drum is front and center, the drummers smile pulls my eye to him as well.  The grain also adds to the image, fulfilling the challenge well.', '2013-05-01 22:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7030704, 1067143, 64989, '<td valign="top">I love the different contrasts here.  Crisp clarity of the foreground versus the grain in the background; pure white versus deep black.  Great job, challenge well met.</td>', 'I love the different contrasts here.  Crisp clarity of the foreground versus the grain in the background; pure white versus deep black.  Great job, challenge well met.', '2013-05-01 22:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7030706, 1067167, 64989, '<td valign="top">Love. That is all.</td>', 'Love. That is all.', '2013-05-01 22:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7030707, 1066855, 64989, '<td valign="top">Classy simplicity.</td>', 'Classy simplicity.', '2013-05-01 22:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7030710, 1067294, 64989, '<td valign="top">I love the tones here, and the grain really helps to draw the eye to the center. I likey.</td>', 'I love the tones here, and the grain really helps to draw the eye to the center. I likey.', '2013-05-01 22:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
