(7031270, 1067456, 136989, '<td valign="top">Terrific emotion.  Beautiful capture.  I love the soft lines and dreamy highlights in her eyes.  The bricks add depth and interest. I also like how her hair fades into the background to add to the flow of the pieces.</td>', 'Terrific emotion.  Beautiful capture.  I love the soft lines and dreamy highlights in her eyes.  The bricks add depth and interest. I also like how her hair fades into the background to add to the flow of the pieces.', '2013-05-03 00:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
